<section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px;">

<div style="padding:24px;margin-bottom:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);">
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Expert taping and jointing for walls and ceilings across Edinburgh. Smooth, crack-resistant finishes ready for painting from British Gypsum and Knauf products. Faster and cleaner than traditional plastering with Scottish Building Standards compliance. 12-month guarantee.</p>
