<h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">How It Works</h2>
<ol style="list-style:decimal;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
  <li><strong>Free Quote:</strong> Call or fill in our form. We will assess your project scope and provide a detailed, no-obligation quote for your Edinburgh property.</li>
  <li><strong>Detailed Plan:</strong> We confirm the scope, timeline, and any specific requirements including board type, jointing standard, and finishing level. Everything is agreed upfront with no hidden extras.</li>
  <li><strong>Professional Application:</strong> Our skilled finishers apply tape and compound in multiple coats (typically 3 coats), sanding between each layer for a flawless result. We work cleanly with dust extraction and minimal disruption.</li>
  <li><strong>Quality Check & Handover:</strong> We inspect every joint and corner under raking light, ensure the surface is paint-ready, and leave your site clean with full quality documentation.</li>
</ol>

